# ── LocalWheels Frontend — Production Environment ─────────────────────────────
# This file is loaded automatically by Vite during `npm run build`.
# Values here OVERRIDE frontend/.env for production builds.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Clerk SSO (REQUIRED for production) ──────────────────────────────────────
# LocalWheels uses Clerk as the sole authentication provider.
# A production Clerk key (pk_live_*) is required. Dev keys (pk_test_*) only
# work on localhost and will fail on the production domain.
#
# To get your production key:
#   1. Go to https://dashboard.clerk.com
#   2. Create or open your production Clerk application
#   3. Add https://localwheels.vinofyx.com to the Allowed Origins
#   4. Copy the Publishable Key (pk_live_...) from API Keys
#   5. Paste it below
#
VITE_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=pk_live_REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_PRODUCTION_KEY

# ── API URL ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# On Hostinger (same domain): leave unset — frontend uses relative '/api' paths.
# Nginx/LiteSpeed proxies /api/* → Express backend on localhost.
#
# Only set if the API runs on a separate domain or subdomain:
#   VITE_API_URL=https://api.localwheels.vinofyx.com/api
# VITE_API_URL=
